# one removed prompt passes with the lower-the-floor note, and prose like "could
# not read ... guest-shape" is not a prompt. Pre-fix: FAILS, the
# decider does not exist. Pure source reads, so it runs on every regime.
#
# STEP_SCRIPT is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
